Feature: valve-winegstreamer
Description: Valve winegstreamer delta, ported from ValveSoftware/wine proton_11.0. Eleven commits: the Proton media-converter GStreamer elements (audioconv, audioconvbin, videoconv, fossilize, murmur3) wired into wg_init_gstreamer, the aac_decoder -> audio_decoder rename that the later audio-decoder fixes anchor on, WMA 5.1/7.1 channel masks, drain/flush for the audio decoder, output block-align/bytes-per-second recalculation, the H264 aperture padding fix, and the rb-tree media-converter framework (payload_hash -> fozdb_hash rename, entry_name -> fozdb_key rename, GList -> rb_tree for discard sets, rb tree for file chunks, read_size init) that the winedmo mediaconv chain builds on. Commits 0001-0002 are retargeted onto the WineHQ base (media-converter/ is new here, and the rename pre-image differs by two later upstream fixes); 0003-0006 apply unchanged; 0007 and 0009 are retargeted (videoconv hunks adjusted for skipped intermediate refactors, 0009 drops an EOF-newline hunk for absent code); 0008, 0010-0011 apply unchanged.
